  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposal by reason of its limited floorspace and cramped room width within Room 5 would represent a sub-standard and inappropriate form of accommodation which would not be capable of meeting the reasonable needs of the future occupier. The proposal is thereby contrary to Policy D6 of the London Plan, Policy CP4 of the Enfield Plan Core Strategy and the guidance contained within the National Planning Policy Framework (2024).",
    "The proposed HMO by virtue of its contrived and poor layout to detail a cramped and inaccessible communal kitchen space would fail to provide the reasonable circulation space  and ease of occupant access required for the development, thereby realising an extremely substandard design layout and it would be significantly detrimental to the residential amenities of the future occupants, contrary to Policies D3 and D6 of the London Plan (2021) as well as the  requirements outlined within the NPPF (2024).",
    "Insufficient information has been submitted by way of flood mitigations including finished floor levels and Flood Evacuation Plan to demonstrate that the proposal would be safe from flooding and it would not be to the detriment of occupants within the ground floor bedrooms during a flooding event. The proposal is contrary to Policy DMD60 of the Development Management Document as well as Policy SI 12 of the London Plan (2021)."
  ],
